WEBVTT

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:02.600
If you've got too much
money, don't buy this, okay?

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:05.440
It's a robot arm that stays in one
spot just to stir things around

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:06.600
badly, on the stove.

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:09.520
There it goes. Look at it
struggling to add things.

00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:11.320
That came out salty, I can already tell.

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:13.600
What the? How much salt is that?

00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:14.760
It doesn't have arteries to clog, right?

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:19.160
The kitchen without the
robot arm is £128,000.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:21.840
With the arm, £248,000.

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:23.260
Man, you'd have to be a real sucker.

00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:25.160
Then the chef comes in
afterwards to finish the dish.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:27.560
Even if I win the lottery,
I don't want one of these.

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:28.560
I want the chef.

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:31.179
No, if I win the lottery,
it'd be just to show off.
